- **Features (`Features/`):** Contains UI and ViewModels.
  - *Rule:* Refer to [ui-design.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/ui-design.mdc) for styling and haptics.
- **Domain (`Domain/`):** Pure business logic, protocols, and models.
  - *Rule:* Refer to [service-factory.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/service-factory.mdc) for DI patterns.
- **Data (`Data/`):** API (Gemini), Persistence (SwiftData), and Firebase.
